(232346, 13898, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice find, pretty incredible to see a natural 16.  <br/> <br/>Good pic, too, though the shadows in the upper left don''t agree with me too well.</td>', 'Nice find, pretty incredible to see a natural 16.   Good pic, too, though the shadows in the upper left don''t agree with me too well.', '2003-03-10 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
