(232351, 13884, 5007, '<td valign="top">Not sure what number this is supposed to be but it doesn''t seem to be what the contest was about.</td>', 'Not sure what number this is supposed to be but it doesn''t seem to be what the contest was about.', '2003-03-10 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
