(232444, 13898, 2, '<td valign="top">Who you callin a pansy?  (I hope I''m the first person to make this joke).  I see eights, so I''m going to say you met the challenge.  I like the composition.  The focus is a little bothersome.  Overall nice work.</td>', 'Who you callin a pansy?  (I hope I''m the first person to make this joke).  I see eights, so I''m going to say you met the challenge.  I like the composition.  The focus is a little bothersome.  Overall nice work.', '2003-03-10 00:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
