(233393, 13717, 4501, '<td valign="top">In mop this does not meet the challenge</td>', 'In mop this does not meet the challenge', '2003-03-10 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(233436, 13672, 6855, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool - I am assuming these are clouds?  Really great perspective.</td>', 'Wow, very cool - I am assuming these are clouds?  Really great perspective.', '2003-03-10 14:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233437, 13952, 6855, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot - very crisp and clear, I really like this one alot!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot - very crisp and clear, I really like this one alot!', '2003-03-10 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(233438, 13722, 6855, '<td valign="top">Wow, that really DOES look like the #4! So easy to see, and the shot is very crisp! Great work!</td>', 'Wow, that really DOES look like the #4! So easy to see, and the shot is very crisp! Great work!', '2003-03-10 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(233440, 13979, 6855, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, but they don''t seem close enough to really make an 8.  Don''t get me wrong- your angle and the quality is superb, and I think it''s absolutely stunning.</td>', 'This is so pretty, but they don''t seem close enough to really make an 8.  Don''t get me wrong- your angle and the quality is superb, and I think it''s absolutely stunning.', '2003-03-10 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(233441, 13795, 6855, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Not only is it unique, but the photography is perfect.  Really a gorgeous shot!</td>', 'I love this!  Not only is it unique, but the photography is perfect.  Really a gorgeous shot!', '2003-03-10 14:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(233607, 13732, 3032, '<td valign="top">The bad troll from hell! Run for your lives!</td>', 'The bad troll from hell! Run for your lives!', '2003-03-10 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(233635, 13754, 1054, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, which required that the subject be naturally occurring (not manufactured in any way), which is a shame, because this is a truly outstanding photograph.</td>', 'In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, which required that the subject be naturally occurring (not manufactured in any way), which is a shame, because this is a truly outstanding photograph.', '2003-03-10 14:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233665, 13726, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot. The background is busy but it works and because of the light/title I get it.</td>', 'Nicely shot. The background is busy but it works and because of the light/title I get it.', '2003-03-10 15:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(233667, 13610, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice. Love the light, focus.<br/></td>', 'Nice. Love the light, focus.', '2003-03-10 15:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233669, 13769, 6504, '<td valign="top">What perfect two''s.  That''s what so wonderful about this site, to see things that are not so obvious at first glance.  You have chosen perfect subjects!</td>', 'What perfect two''s.  That''s what so wonderful about this site, to see things that are not so obvious at first glance.  You have chosen perfect subjects!', '2003-03-10 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(233672, 13656, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, lots of sevens.  Cold calculating icicles.  Excellent photo.</td>', 'Oh yes, lots of sevens.  Cold calculating icicles.  Excellent photo.', '2003-03-10 15:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233674, 13672, 6504, '<td valign="top">These colors are magnificent.  Is it a flower?  Very unusual and beautiful.</td>', 'These colors are magnificent.  Is it a flower?  Very unusual and beautiful.', '2003-03-10 15:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233675, 13732, 6458, '<td valign="top">This shot floors me. It feels like the trees are actually moving when I look at it. The only thing I wish is that the upper circle was better defined. Apart from that I don''t have any ideas for making it any better.</td>', 'This shot floors me. It feels like the trees are actually moving when I look at it. The only thing I wish is that the upper circle was better defined. Apart from that I don''t have any ideas for making it any better.', '2003-03-10 15:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(233676, 13610, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, that''s a six alright!  And beautifully done.  The shadows and texture are very good.</td>', 'Oh yes, that''s a six alright!  And beautifully done.  The shadows and texture are very good.', '2003-03-10 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(233677, 13773, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, but could it be a tad sharper? How in the world did you find such a perfect subject for this challenge?</td>', 'Very beautiful, but could it be a tad sharper? How in the world did you find such a perfect subject for this challenge?', '2003-03-10 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(233678, 13754, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.. The use of B&amp;W hides the numbers and the adition of "RayMond" gives the shot the needed human presence. I laughed (and groaned) when I saw this - not many pictures tickle me like this. Congratulations!</td>', 'This is a great shot.. The use of B&W hides the numbers and the adition of "RayMond" gives the shot the needed human presence. I laughed (and groaned) when I saw this - not many pictures tickle me like this. Congratulations!', '2003-03-10 15:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(233681, 13754, 6504, '<td valign="top">Is Raymond 007?   I get it, and I think it''s a wonderful photgraph!!<br/>I love the wine carrier and the bottles.  007 is about to go have a good time.</td>', 'Is Raymond 007?   I get it, and I think it''s a wonderful photgraph!!I love the wine carrier and the bottles.  007 is about to go have a good time.', '2003-03-10 15:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(233682, 13702, 6458, '<td valign="top">Oh, I''m jealous! I was looking all over for a shot like this, to no avail. You''ve found a perfect one! Great technical work and I love the composition.</td>', 'Oh, I''m jealous! I was looking all over for a shot like this, to no avail. You''ve found a perfect one! Great technical work and I love the composition.', '2003-03-10 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(233683, 13726, 6504, '<td valign="top">Now that is a good one!  I would not see those numbers if it weren''t  the challenge.<br/>Very beautiful photograph, perfect colors.</td>', 'Now that is a good one!  I would not see those numbers if it weren''t  the challenge.Very beautiful photograph, perfect colors.', '2003-03-10 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(233684, 13780, 6504, '<td valign="top">You are a clever one!   This is a great photo for the challenge.  A little more light on the duck''s face and it would be perfect.</td>', 'You are a clever one!   This is a great photo for the challenge.  A little more light on the duck''s face and it would be perfect.', '2003-03-10 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(233685, 13696, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, graceful lines, perfect color.  Excellent</td>', 'Very beautiful, graceful lines, perfect color.  Excellent', '2003-03-10 15:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(233688, 13967, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great textures and colors! One of my highest rated this competition. The only thing lacking for me is the composition. The number is there right in front of you and it doesn''t leave anywhere for the eye to wander - my eye wants to follow the grain of the sandstone to the upper left but is disappointed when the picture ends. This is personal preference though, so congrats on a great shot!</td>', 'Great textures and colors! One of my highest rated this competition. The only thing lacking for me is the composition. The number is there right in front of you and it doesn''t leave anywhere for the eye to wander - my eye wants to follow the grain of the sandstone to the upper left but is disappointed when the picture ends. This is personal preference though, so congrats on a great shot!', '2003-03-10 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(233689, 13798, 6504, '<td valign="top">I see the three''s okay!  The lighting is a little harsh and distracts from the threes, but a very good photo for the challenge.</td>', 'I see the three''s okay!  The lighting is a little harsh and distracts from the threes, but a very good photo for the challenge.', '2003-03-10 15:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(233690, 13856, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I like the colors and textures.  Perfect choice.</td>', 'Very good.  I like the colors and textures.  Perfect choice.', '2003-03-10 15:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(233692, 13689, 6504, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, but a very good idea.</td>', 'A little out of focus, but a very good idea.', '2003-03-10 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(233693, 13736, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good sky colors, it''s stretching it a little to see the 7 though.</td>', 'Good sky colors, it''s stretching it a little to see the 7 though.', '2003-03-10 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233695, 13754, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Perfect focus and composition. The light sepia tone makes it. For me it meets the challenge. My only favourite this week. Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot! Perfect focus and composition. The light sepia tone makes it. For me it meets the challenge. My only favourite this week. Good luck!', '2003-03-10 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(233696, 13902, 4793, '<td valign="top">Looks man made to me!</td>', 'Looks man made to me!', '2003-03-10 15:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(233698, 13769, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I was looking for one of these myself. I snapped about 20 pictures of swans but couldn''t get them to "pose" as nicely as you did. The other water fowl in the background is a nice touch as well!  My only criticism is that the colors on the swans seems a bit dull. I would have liked to seen this picture with the contrast increased slightly to really bring out the whiteness of the swans. (I had this same problem with my swan shots, and I couldn''t find one that really *wowed* me).</td>', 'Great shot! I was looking for one of these myself. I snapped about 20 pictures of swans but couldn''t get them to "pose" as nicely as you did. The other water fowl in the background is a nice touch as well!  My only criticism is that the colors on the swans seems a bit dull. I would have liked to seen this picture with the contrast increased slightly to really bring out the whiteness of the swans. (I had this same problem with my swan shots, and I couldn''t find one that really *wowed* me).', '2003-03-10 15:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(233702, 13758, 6855, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I really love this!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I really love this!', '2003-03-10 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(233704, 13626, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very cool - I think it would have been better in color though (just an opinion)</td>', 'Very cool - I think it would have been better in color though (just an opinion)', '2003-03-10 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(233705, 13967, 6855, '<td valign="top">Neat - I love the colors.</td>', 'Neat - I love the colors.', '2003-03-10 15:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(233706, 13726, 6855, '<td valign="top">Great eye, and a very clever way to meet the challenge!  Seems a bit busy, but I still like it and the quality is fantastic.</td>', 'Great eye, and a very clever way to meet the challenge!  Seems a bit busy, but I still like it and the quality is fantastic.', '2003-03-10 15:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
