(233751, 13885, 6504, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo, I would have put some paint on the browning part of the corn, other than that a good choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice clear photo, I would have put some paint on the browning part of the corn, other than that a good choice for this challenge.', '2003-03-10 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
