(233857, 13696, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good "7" there.  I would have rotated it to the left a few degrees to get the top part level.  Then maybe used a strong light from the top.</td>', 'Pretty good "7" there.  I would have rotated it to the left a few degrees to get the top part level.  Then maybe used a strong light from the top.', '2003-03-10 17:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
