(233866, 13898, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a GREAT number 3 there!  But you should have absolutely zoomed in on it and cropped so it''s more dominant in the picture.  This could have been really good if you did that.</td>', 'Wow that''s a GREAT number 3 there!  But you should have absolutely zoomed in on it and cropped so it''s more dominant in the picture.  This could have been really good if you did that.', '2003-03-10 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
