(233873, 13795, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good one.  You really had to show as much as you did to show what it is.  Plus this picture is very good on it''s own (not showing a number).</td>', 'Good one.  You really had to show as much as you did to show what it is.  Plus this picture is very good on it''s own (not showing a number).', '2003-03-10 17:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
