(234471, 13898, 6182, '<td valign="top">This had so much potential in my opinion but it was left untapped....i definitely would have used a different color background...the white really doesn''t compliment the colors in the pansy at all.   i would rethink the cropping as well...there''s far too much space ...i probably would have tried to crop in order to make the "3" the focal point...it really took me awhile to realize that "3" was the #.  i think your focus could have been a bit sharper as well.</td>', 'This had so much potential in my opinion but it was left untapped....i definitely would have used a different color background...the white really doesn''t compliment the colors in the pansy at all.   i would rethink the cropping as well...there''s far too much space ...i probably would have tried to crop in order to make the "3" the focal point...it really took me awhile to realize that "3" was the #.  i think your focus could have been a bit sharper as well.', '2003-03-10 23:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(234477, 13620, 6182, '<td valign="top">as far as tree numbers go,  yours is probably my favorite because i didn''t find any "5"''s in trees (i saw an awful lot of 7''s and 1''s and 8''s)  and because i like the way that the background doesn''t interfere with the form of the number.  i do think that i would have liked it even better had you cropped in a bit closer.</td>', 'as far as tree numbers go,  yours is probably my favorite because i didn''t find any "5"''s in trees (i saw an awful lot of 7''s and 1''s and 8''s)  and because i like the way that the background doesn''t interfere with the form of the number.  i do think that i would have liked it even better had you cropped in a bit closer.', '2003-03-10 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(234558, 13600, 5212, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting, great photo for this challenge.  Good luck, 8</td>', 'Dramatic lighting, great photo for this challenge.  Good luck, 8', '2003-03-11 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(234559, 13620, 5212, '<td valign="top">Cool 15, and great title.  Good luck!</td>', 'Cool 15, and great title.  Good luck!', '2003-03-11 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(234561, 13758, 5212, '<td valign="top">Not wild about your border, love the shadows and the unusual lighting/exposure your chose.</td>', 'Not wild about your border, love the shadows and the unusual lighting/exposure your chose.', '2003-03-11 01:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(234562, 13819, 5212, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, might not be my idea of the challenge, but am open to your interpretation.</td>', 'Cool photo, might not be my idea of the challenge, but am open to your interpretation.', '2003-03-11 01:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(234563, 13884, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to interpret this challenge.  Interesting use of color vs neutral tones.</td>', 'Interesting way to interpret this challenge.  Interesting use of color vs neutral tones.', '2003-03-11 01:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(234564, 13610, 5212, '<td valign="top">For this challenge, would have liked to see more depth of field emphasizing the top part of the six.  Beautiful image, though.  6</td>', 'For this challenge, would have liked to see more depth of field emphasizing the top part of the six.  Beautiful image, though.  6', '2003-03-11 01:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(234565, 13578, 5212, '<td valign="top">Spikey eight!  I might have liked this with a softer light, but that''s just one opinion.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Spikey eight!  I might have liked this with a softer light, but that''s just one opinion.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-03-11 01:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(234566, 13702, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot for a difficult challenge to meet.   I like your crop and the photo is very clear.</td>', 'Great shot for a difficult challenge to meet.   I like your crop and the photo is very clear.', '2003-03-11 01:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(234569, 13815, 5212, '<td valign="top">Dramatic use of ''empty'' space, nice dof, good job meeting the challenge.  7</td>', 'Dramatic use of ''empty'' space, nice dof, good job meeting the challenge.  7', '2003-03-11 01:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(234584, 13754, 6893, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2003-03-11 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(234593, 13743, 6893, '<td valign="top">Nice find...</td>', 'Nice find...', '2003-03-11 02:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(234598, 13624, 6068, '<td valign="top">Hahahahah.. too funny.. Great!</td>', 'Hahahahah.. too funny.. Great!', '2003-03-11 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(234600, 13689, 4871, '<td valign="top">I love the pics that are ''thinking outside the square''... this one is unreal! I love what you''ve done with the color too... great!</td>', 'I love the pics that are ''thinking outside the square''... this one is unreal! I love what you''ve done with the color too... great!', '2003-03-11 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(234611, 13773, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great portrayal of textures and natural colors.  This is especially impressive in a single piece of wood.  I think the framing is good, but might improve the effect of the picture if the lighter brown circle was placed on the bottom right corner.  It would give a little room for the circle to open up to.  I''m not sure how to describe it exactly.  Maybe I''m way off anyway... Nice shot whatever the case</td>', 'Great portrayal of textures and natural colors.  This is especially impressive in a single piece of wood.  I think the framing is good, but might improve the effect of the picture if the lighter brown circle was placed on the bottom right corner.  It would give a little room for the circle to open up to.  I''m not sure how to describe it exactly.  Maybe I''m way off anyway... Nice shot whatever the case', '2003-03-11 05:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(234613, 13769, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Great contrast between the bird and the water further increases the effectiveness of this shot.  Nice job</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Great contrast between the bird and the water further increases the effectiveness of this shot.  Nice job', '2003-03-11 05:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(234615, 13696, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very soft photo, effectively soft that is.  Like the colors as well.</td>', 'Very soft photo, effectively soft that is.  Like the colors as well.', '2003-03-11 05:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(234618, 13815, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and exposure.  The colors are nice too.  I''m not sold on the framing and I think this is a little softer than it should be.  Not a bad photo overall.</td>', 'Good lighting and exposure.  The colors are nice too.  I''m not sold on the framing and I think this is a little softer than it should be.  Not a bad photo overall.', '2003-03-11 05:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(234624, 13759, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis is pretty good but I really don''t like the large branch or vine running from the large trunk up diagonally thru the top of the 4</td>', 'THis is pretty good but I really don''t like the large branch or vine running from the large trunk up diagonally thru the top of the 4', '2003-03-11 05:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(234628, 13553, 3540, '<td valign="top">Dynamic color.  Clever title to boot.  Great idea and shot!</td>', 'Dynamic color.  Clever title to boot.  Great idea and shot!', '2003-03-11 05:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(234629, 13569, 3540, '<td valign="top">The DOF is too shallow to make this a really effective shot.  The colors are great, the shell is great, the framing I think could be better but the DOF is just too shallow</td>', 'The DOF is too shallow to make this a really effective shot.  The colors are great, the shell is great, the framing I think could be better but the DOF is just too shallow', '2003-03-11 05:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(234630, 13798, 3540, '<td valign="top">The burnouts on the leaves, on purpose or not really turn me off to this picture.  Sorry, I just have a hard time looking past them.</td>', 'The burnouts on the leaves, on purpose or not really turn me off to this picture.  Sorry, I just have a hard time looking past them.', '2003-03-11 05:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(234631, 13885, 3540, '<td valign="top">Framing is a bit off IMO for this shot.  The crispness of the corn isn''t quite there.  This is striking me as odd because I can see the grain of whatever textile you used underneath the cob.  Pretty good overall tho</td>', 'Framing is a bit off IMO for this shot.  The crispness of the corn isn''t quite there.  This is striking me as odd because I can see the grain of whatever textile you used underneath the cob.  Pretty good overall tho', '2003-03-11 05:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(234636, 13792, 4501, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, good focus etc.background is tad to overpowering for me!!!!</td>', 'meets the challenge, good focus etc.background is tad to overpowering for me!!!!', '2003-03-11 06:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(234672, 13792, 3469, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the colors and the structure of the background. I don''t like the lighting and the focus might have been more on the shell. All in all this is no longer ''natural'' but a constructed and composed picture, so you might have had the opportunity to improve lighting and focus, I suppose.</td>', 'I like the idea of the colors and the structure of the background. I don''t like the lighting and the focus might have been more on the shell. All in all this is no longer ''natural'' but a constructed and composed picture, so you might have had the opportunity to improve lighting and focus, I suppose.', '2003-03-11 08:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(234674, 13915, 3469, '<td valign="top">i like the composition of the picture, but as to the natural numbers and the title you lost me.</td>', 'i like the composition of the picture, but as to the natural numbers and the title you lost me.', '2003-03-11 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(234712, 13732, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good find! This really hits the challenge bang on, good choice of sepia toning.</td>', 'Good find! This really hits the challenge bang on, good choice of sepia toning.', '2003-03-11 09:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(234922, 13600, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is the best photo!!  The idea behind it is great, and the title is great, and it''s definately a natural number.  Made me laugh out loud.  I think the only thing that could be improved is if he wasn''t looking at you like he wanted to bite you.  lol.  It''s natural for him to want to look at you though, even at the angle he''s facing.  Focus and clarity are great on the 9.  I love the dark background with lit subject.  A great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is the best photo!!  The idea behind it is great, and the title is great, and it''s definately a natural number.  Made me laugh out loud.  I think the only thing that could be improved is if he wasn''t looking at you like he wanted to bite you.  lol.  It''s natural for him to want to look at you though, even at the angle he''s facing.  Focus and clarity are great on the 9.  I love the dark background with lit subject.  A great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 11:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(234924, 13760, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately natural numbers.  It''s not too complex or busy.  That''s a good thing, but it''s also not "jump out of my seat" exciting.  It does meet the challenge, and it is technically well done.  focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this is also good.  it just seems to be missing something.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately natural numbers.  It''s not too complex or busy.  That''s a good thing, but it''s also not "jump out of my seat" exciting.  It does meet the challenge, and it is technically well done.  focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this is also good.  it just seems to be missing something.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 11:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(234929, 13790, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus seems just a bit soft for my taste.  Having such a tiny area of subject to focus on though could be difficult.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  You left enough space around the subject without crowding it.  Definately a natural number.  lighting conditions also appear to have been cooperating with you that day.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Focus seems just a bit soft for my taste.  Having such a tiny area of subject to focus on though could be difficult.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  You left enough space around the subject without crowding it.  Definately a natural number.  lighting conditions also appear to have been cooperating with you that day.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(234934, 13620, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first, I was thinking "how can you take a pic of a mesh of branches and expect us to pick out a number"  Then looking a bit, trying to find an obvious one, that 15 jumped right out at me.  absolutely amazing!  I wonder how this would look if you cropped it to the bottom of the horizontal branch that the 15 is sitting on.  It might help to draw our eyes right to the 15 rather than trying to search for it.  Not like it''s not obvious, lol, I think I''m having a dumb moment. focus and clarity are good, as is lighting conditions.  Great find!! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first, I was thinking "how can you take a pic of a mesh of branches and expect us to pick out a number"  Then looking a bit, trying to find an obvious one, that 15 jumped right out at me.  absolutely amazing!  I wonder how this would look if you cropped it to the bottom of the horizontal branch that the 15 is sitting on.  It might help to draw our eyes right to the 15 rather than trying to search for it.  Not like it''s not obvious, lol, I think I''m having a dumb moment. focus and clarity are good, as is lighting conditions.  Great find!! Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(234938, 13693, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure weather or not to consider this a naturally occuring number.  The shot it''s self is quite set up, and the key isn''t natural, however, it''s not naturally suposed to be a number, but it does look like one.  I guess I''m going to just comment on the photo its self.  The white background is so bright that it''s almost consuming some of the keys.  it''s most visible in the small tip in the middle to the bottom.  The background bleeds into the subject a bit.  Not sure how to fix it, other than a less harsh lighting or slightly darker background.  Focus and clarity are excelent.  Very nice focus.  Angle and framing/cropping are ok, the shadow distracts a bit.  Overall, a decent photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not really sure weather or not to consider this a naturally occuring number.  The shot it''s self is quite set up, and the key isn''t natural, however, it''s not naturally suposed to be a number, but it does look like one.  I guess I''m going to just comment on the photo its self.  The white background is so bright that it''s almost consuming some of the keys.  it''s most visible in the small tip in the middle to the bottom.  The background bleeds into the subject a bit.  Not sure how to fix it, other than a less harsh lighting or slightly darker background.  Focus and clarity are excelent.  Very nice focus.  Angle and framing/cropping are ok, the shadow distracts a bit.  Overall, a decent photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 11:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(234983, 13898, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great find!  The lighting makes this photo a little too flat.  It could be a little sharper also.  Good framing.</td>', 'Great find!  The lighting makes this photo a little too flat.  It could be a little sharper also.  Good framing.', '2003-03-11 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(234986, 13856, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good colors of the tree.  The river looks a little yucky in the color department tho I really like the reflections.  Too bad the sky is so overcast.  A little more of a clear dusk would''ve helped a lot.</td>', 'Good colors of the tree.  The river looks a little yucky in the color department tho I really like the reflections.  Too bad the sky is so overcast.  A little more of a clear dusk would''ve helped a lot.', '2003-03-11 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(234994, 13624, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about 4.  Looks like #2 to me :)</td>', 'I don''t know about 4.  Looks like #2 to me :)', '2003-03-11 12:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(234997, 13952, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great texture and color portrayal.  Not real sure about the framing but I wouldn''t consider it bad.  Excellent DOF.  Overall its pretty good I figure.</td>', 'Great texture and color portrayal.  Not real sure about the framing but I wouldn''t consider it bad.  Excellent DOF.  Overall its pretty good I figure.', '2003-03-11 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(235001, 13774, 4501, '<td valign="top">Focus is god  but to cluutered</td>', 'Focus is god  but to cluutered', '2003-03-11 13:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(235007, 13600, 4501, '<td valign="top">Good shot of what in my experience with my dog is a difficult subject</td>', 'Good shot of what in my experience with my dog is a difficult subject', '2003-03-11 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(235009, 13682, 4501, '<td valign="top">Good shot but inmop it needs a greater dof so the top and r/h side would appear to be in focus and not blurred</td>', 'Good shot but inmop it needs a greater dof so the top and r/h side would appear to be in focus and not blurred', '2003-03-11 13:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(235010, 13654, 4501, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge but in mop just a bit over exposed</td>', 'meets the challenge but in mop just a bit over exposed', '2003-03-11 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(235022, 13898, 6504, '<td valign="top">Do you think a little more light reflecting on the pansy might bring it out more?<br/>When I looked at this I thought   Of course, there''s the 3.  Why have I never noticed it in a pansy?   Very good picure.</td>', 'Do you think a little more light reflecting on the pansy might bring it out more?When I looked at this I thought   Of course, there''s the 3.  Why have I never noticed it in a pansy?   Very good picure.', '2003-03-11 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(235023, 13982, 6504, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is great!  The clarity, color, compostion is very good.  Yes, it is a number 7.</td>', 'The backlighting is great!  The clarity, color, compostion is very good.  Yes, it is a number 7.', '2003-03-11 13:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(235026, 13624, 6504, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you had a bigger aperture you could have blurred out  clara clara clara, The man walking by would be blurred but still visible.  He is obviously ignoring the chap on the throne.    Clever idea you had.</td>', 'Maybe if you had a bigger aperture you could have blurred out  clara clara clara, The man walking by would be blurred but still visible.  He is obviously ignoring the chap on the throne.    Clever idea you had.', '2003-03-11 13:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(235028, 13647, 6504, '<td valign="top">That''s clearly a seven.   The picture is a little small, though.  I know you probably haven''t had much sunshine last week like everyone else, but this would have  been very good with more light.   Good picture.</td>', 'That''s clearly a seven.   The picture is a little small, though.  I know you probably haven''t had much sunshine last week like everyone else, but this would have  been very good with more light.   Good picture.', '2003-03-11 13:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(235030, 13790, 6504, '<td valign="top">It''s as if this limb was just waiting for you and the challenge!  Very good!</td>', 'It''s as if this limb was just waiting for you and the challenge!  Very good!', '2003-03-11 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(235031, 13743, 6504, '<td valign="top">Hard to decide the number.  (1)?  Nice texture, but would be nice with more light, and clarity.</td>', 'Hard to decide the number.  (1)?  Nice texture, but would be nice with more light, and clarity.', '2003-03-11 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(235040, 13758, 6504, '<td valign="top">The mist is pretty in this picture, and the dew on the grass, the incline.<br/>I do see the number 11.  Very good photo</td>', 'The mist is pretty in this picture, and the dew on the grass, the incline.I do see the number 11.  Very good photo', '2003-03-11 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
