(235629, 13654, 3080, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  I lke the sepia tones.  I wonder if this would improve from some added contrast.  the snow looks a bit grey.  however, adding contrast may make the sky way too white, so I''d have to see it, maybe you made the right decision.   definately a natural number.  the focus and clarity are good, as is the angle and framing/cropping.  overall a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'nice shot.  I lke the sepia tones.  I wonder if this would improve from some added contrast.  the snow looks a bit grey.  however, adding contrast may make the sky way too white, so I''d have to see it, maybe you made the right decision.   definately a natural number.  the focus and clarity are good, as is the angle and framing/cropping.  overall a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(235635, 13898, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the color.  The 3 doesn''t seem to be the part that is mostly in focus though.  to me, it seems that the left side of the flower is in better focus than the right.  I think I''d like to see this the other way around.  I like the placement of the flower within the photo.  nice angle and framing/cropping.  The lighting is almost too harsh around the edges on the far right and bottom.  an excelent naturally occuring number.  very nice find. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the color.  The 3 doesn''t seem to be the part that is mostly in focus though.  to me, it seems that the left side of the flower is in better focus than the right.  I think I''d like to see this the other way around.  I like the placement of the flower within the photo.  nice angle and framing/cropping.  The lighting is almost too harsh around the edges on the far right and bottom.  an excelent naturally occuring number.  very nice find. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(235643, 13672, 3080, '<td valign="top">looks like a sideways sky shot.  definately an 11 though.  it seems a bit grainy also.  otherwise, the colors are nice, nice bright colors.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'looks like a sideways sky shot.  definately an 11 though.  it seems a bit grainy also.  otherwise, the colors are nice, nice bright colors.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(235645, 13689, 3080, '<td valign="top">I had intrepreted the challenge to show a physical number, not something that we had to count.  With that in mind, I definately see a 0 here.  :)  While the focus and clarity are good, I think that the lighting was a bit harsh for you.  There are a couple bright spots that almost wash out the subject in some places. mainly to the bottom right.  the angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think that I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I had intrepreted the challenge to show a physical number, not something that we had to count.  With that in mind, I definately see a 0 here.  :)  While the focus and clarity are good, I think that the lighting was a bit harsh for you.  There are a couple bright spots that almost wash out the subject in some places. mainly to the bottom right.  the angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think that I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(235647, 13979, 3080, '<td valign="top">aww.  cute littly 8''s too.  very pretty flowers.  the background is nicely blurred and not distracting at all.  your focus and clarity are excelent.  lighting, for the most part was quite cooperative.  only a few minor spots where it looks a little bright on the petals.  nothing serious however.  great angle and framing/cropping.  not only do the petals form little 8''s, the 2 round bundles of flowers also form an angled 8.  very nice find.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'aww.  cute littly 8''s too.  very pretty flowers.  the background is nicely blurred and not distracting at all.  your focus and clarity are excelent.  lighting, for the most part was quite cooperative.  only a few minor spots where it looks a little bright on the petals.  nothing serious however.  great angle and framing/cropping.  not only do the petals form little 8''s, the 2 round bundles of flowers also form an angled 8.  very nice find.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(235651, 13782, 3080, '<td valign="top">i bet you were so focused on the 7, that you didn''t even notice the 8 in the upper left hand corner. :)  your focus and clarity are good.  angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  I was messing with some cropping options and I also like this cropped at the very bottom of the "8" in the upper left hand corner, so the 7 fills the entire photo, from top to bottom.  lighting conditions look good for the shot as well.  nice find. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'i bet you were so focused on the 7, that you didn''t even notice the 8 in the upper left hand corner. :)  your focus and clarity are good.  angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  I was messing with some cropping options and I also like this cropped at the very bottom of the "8" in the upper left hand corner, so the 7 fills the entire photo, from top to bottom.  lighting conditions look good for the shot as well.  nice find. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(235653, 13834, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first, I was too tired to see any numbers in this shot.  however, then I saw the necks of the geese look like 2s, and the legs look like 11''s.  your focus and clarity are very good here.  there is excelent detail in the goose feathers and in the ground.  I like the use of black and white.  lighting conditions appear to have been very nice for the shot as well.  a great photo.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first, I was too tired to see any numbers in this shot.  however, then I saw the necks of the geese look like 2s, and the legs look like 11''s.  your focus and clarity are very good here.  there is excelent detail in the goose feathers and in the ground.  I like the use of black and white.  lighting conditions appear to have been very nice for the shot as well.  a great photo.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-11 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
