(237857, 13952, 3585, '<td valign="top">I once visited a institute specialized in dendrochronologic studies. They can date with great precision wood remains, found in archeological digs, that came from trees cut down 5000 year ago!. Good idea, some may, however, find that the concept of number is a little unclear is this image.<br/></td>', 'I once visited a institute specialized in dendrochronologic studies. They can date with great precision wood remains, found in archeological digs, that came from trees cut down 5000 year ago!. Good idea, some may, however, find that the concept of number is a little unclear is this image.', '2003-03-16 04:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237858, 13815, 3585, '<td valign="top">No way to miss that one. Another leaf part (or anything else) on the other side of the image would have perhaps better balanced this image.  8</td>', 'No way to miss that one. Another leaf part (or anything else) on the other side of the image would have perhaps better balanced this image.  8', '2003-03-16 04:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237859, 13553, 3585, '<td valign="top">In the orange pulp, one could also see a couple 6s, 8s, 9s. All depends how obsessive you can get</td>', 'In the orange pulp, one could also see a couple 6s, 8s, 9s. All depends how obsessive you can get', '2003-03-16 04:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237861, 13732, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very expressive nature picture. Number is quite clear. 9</td>', 'Very expressive nature picture. Number is quite clear. 9', '2003-03-16 04:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237862, 13782, 3585, '<td valign="top">447 would suit me as well. Nice study on texture. 8</td>', '447 would suit me as well. Nice study on texture. 8', '2003-03-16 04:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237863, 13983, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, framing could have been improved a bit by keeping the benches in or totally out of the picture. Concerning the quality of the image: you either deserve a better camera or you need to improve your post-production skills.</td>', 'Nice idea, framing could have been improved a bit by keeping the benches in or totally out of the picture. Concerning the quality of the image: you either deserve a better camera or you need to improve your post-production skills.', '2003-03-16 04:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237864, 13898, 3585, '<td valign="top">I''ll go for a fine 16. I would have framed down to that. To much bareness as such.</td>', 'I''ll go for a fine 16. I would have framed down to that. To much bareness as such.', '2003-03-16 04:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
