(237993, 13883, 6325, '<td valign="top">I just could not find a number; where is it? It\''s hard to tell about the exposure since I don\''t know the intent.  _ OK, I came back and saw the 8 this time.</td>', 'I just could not find a number; where is it? It\''s hard to tell about the exposure since I don\''t know the intent.  _ OK, I came back and saw the 8 this time.', '2003-03-16 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
