(238095, 13754, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really nice find.  Curious to know if this was set up or if it''s always like this.  I really like the sepia tones here.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like the angle as well.  I think it''s a good shot with the man in it, but I would also like to see it cropped tighter around just the 007.  LIghting conditions are very good. no hot spots or distracting shadows.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really nice find.  Curious to know if this was set up or if it''s always like this.  I really like the sepia tones here.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like the angle as well.  I think it''s a good shot with the man in it, but I would also like to see it cropped tighter around just the 007.  LIghting conditions are very good. no hot spots or distracting shadows.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(238116, 13885, 3080, '<td valign="top">gosh that looks good.  the texture is very nice.  excelent focus and clarity.  the angle and framing/cropping are good as well. Traditionally, you would see the "face" facing toward the negative space, but I like this way with this shot.  Lighting and colors are excelent.  A great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'gosh that looks good.  the texture is very nice.  excelent focus and clarity.  the angle and framing/cropping are good as well. Traditionally, you would see the "face" facing toward the negative space, but I like this way with this shot.  Lighting and colors are excelent.  A great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(238122, 13792, 3080, '<td valign="top">That''s a whole lot of orange.  Defianately a natural number.  Good find.  The color is nice, maybe just a little TOO orange for my personal taste, but still well done.  focus and clarity are good.  nice detail in the chell and the gravels.  the angle and framing/cropping look nice as well. and the border compliments this very nicely.  good shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a whole lot of orange.  Defianately a natural number.  Good find.  The color is nice, maybe just a little TOO orange for my personal taste, but still well done.  focus and clarity are good.  nice detail in the chell and the gravels.  the angle and framing/cropping look nice as well. and the border compliments this very nicely.  good shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
