(238369, 13569, 5044, '<td valign="top">Well it took some time, but finally a ribbon! WOOHOO! I''m really psyched! Can''t believe it held up, given the tough competition this week. Congrats to the others. <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the great comments, on this challenge and all the previous ones. We improve so much when we get constructive comments, and I owe this ribbon to all the great people at DPC who have helped me learn and better my photographs. <br/> <br/>On to the next challenge....<br/> <br/>Mario<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well it took some time, but finally a ribbon! WOOHOO! I''m really psyched! Can''t believe it held up, given the tough competition this week. Congrats to the others.  Thanks for all the great comments, on this challenge and all the previous ones. We improve so much when we get constructive comments, and I owe this ribbon to all the great people at DPC who have helped me learn and better my photographs.  On to the next challenge.... Mario ', '2003-03-17 01:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
