(239052, 13754, 3102, '<td valign="top">Phew -- NOW I get it!  I honestly looked at this over and over again in an attempt to get it... now I feel like an idiot.  I still rated it highly, and think it was indeed an underrated shot this time around.  I could see this hanging in a Cracker Barrel restaurant :)</td>', 'Phew -- NOW I get it!  I honestly looked at this over and over again in an attempt to get it... now I feel like an idiot.  I still rated it highly, and think it was indeed an underrated shot this time around.  I could see this hanging in a Cracker Barrel restaurant :)', '2003-03-17 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 0),
