(240487, 13693, 6855, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB<br/> <br/>Challenge: Although this is a great photo, I think your only downfall is that it does not meet the challenge which called for a natural occuring number.<br/> <br/>Technical:  Your camera settings appear correct because of the clarity of the keys. Your lighting is great, and the composition looks good too. You may have wanted to spotlight the center key a bit more, as the focus seems to be on all of the keys, even though they are all pointing to the center.<br/> <br/>Style:  Very creative and fun to look at.<br/> <br/>Overall:  A great photo that only scored low because it did not meet the challenge criteria.</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB Challenge: Although this is a great photo, I think your only downfall is that it does not meet the challenge which called for a natural occuring number. Technical:  Your camera settings appear correct because of the clarity of the keys. Your lighting is great, and the composition looks good too. You may have wanted to spotlight the center key a bit more, as the focus seems to be on all of the keys, even though they are all pointing to the center. Style:  Very creative and fun to look at. Overall:  A great photo that only scored low because it did not meet the challenge criteria.', '2003-03-18 14:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
